  "description": "Woobin, the popular boy at school, is secretly a huge fan of the anime \"Love Love Me\", especially its heroine, Yoi. The moment he meets Ah-yoon, a classmate who looks just like Yoi, he falls for her at first sight... A fluttering high school romance between Woo-bin, the popular boy hiding his otaku identity, and Ah-yoon, the ultimate otaku who dreams of sharing her favorite anime with everyone!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
